{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Support ticket: \"Invoice totals are sometimes off by one cent compared to the sum of the\nline items shown on the PDF. Happens maybe one invoice in twenty, only when there are\ndiscounts involved. No errors in logs.\"\n\nThe `billing` package is in this repo. Find the root cause and fix it. Do not change the\npublic API. Add a regression test under `tests/`. Run the full test suite."}, "timestamp": "2026-10-09T17:50:40.611Z"}
